  "description": "Six moulded panels in orange, green, red, navy, yellow and sky blue make up the Abstract Climber, set in two rows between grey steel posts. Each panel is cut through with irregular openings, so children pick their own route up, across and down, using the gaps as hand and foot holds. Working out a route builds grip, balance and problem-solving, and the wall can be climbed from either face. The product area is 5'8\" x 9'4\", and its safe play area of 10'8\" x 14'4\" lets it sit beside a slide or swing in a school ground. Colour is listed as Multi Color. Galvanised pipe, roto-moulded parts and composite laminates on this climber carry a 3-year warranty. Send us your site photos and we will prepare a layout.",
